LINKAGE SECTION.
01 J-THIS BINARY-DOUBLE.
01 J-RESULT BINARY-DOUBLE.
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING J-THIS RETURNING J-RESULT.
    MOVE 0 TO JV-DONE
    MOVE "ABCustomItem" TO JV-CLASS
    IF J-THIS NOT = 0
        MOVE JH-OBJECT-CLASS(J-THIS) TO JV-CLASS
    END-IF
    PERFORM UNTIL JV-DONE = 1
        IF JV-CLASS = "ABCustomItem"
            COMPUTE J-RESULT = FUNCTION ABCustomItem-getMinimumWidth0J(J-THIS)
            MOVE 1 TO JV-DONE
        ELSE
